	\n									Eat. Play. Sip.Wrap up your weekend the right way with Sunday F
	unday at The Works Food Hall! This all-ages celebration brings together gr
	eat food\, live entertainment\, and fun for the whole family. What to Expe
	ct: Delicious Food Vendors serving something for every cravingFamily-Frien
	dly Games & ActivitiesIce-Cold Stella Artois Brews for the adults  Fun Sta
	rts Early & Goes All Day Whether you’re out with family\, friends\, or fly
	ing solo\, there’s something for everyone at Sunday Funday. Come dance\, e
	at\, sip\, and play the day away! Good food. Good brews. Great vibes. One 
	unforgettable Sunday. 								\n				\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n		
